cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use InterveneSim-CF, please cite this software and technical report."
title: "InterveneSim-CF: Learning When to Ask from One Observed Future"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Villalovoz
    given-names: Ethan
repository-code: "https://github.com/ethanvillalovoz/intervenesim"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-08-18
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark that hides one branch of exact simulator counterfactuals during
  training, then audits intervention-effect estimators on unseen robot policies, tasks,
  disturbances, logging policies, costs, and assistance latencies.
keywords:
  - imitation learning
  - interactive imitation learning
  - robot learning
  - corrective interventions
  - causal inference
  - learning to defer
  - simulation
